# Dynamic source rejects an incompatible constrained destination

Verifies a dynamically read kilogram value cannot enter an array constrained
to millimeters when no subtype conversion is registered.

>>> source
let source: int[] = [5kg]
let index = 0
let sizes: int<mm>[] = [source[index]]
print(sizes[0])

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: conversion from `int64[kg]` to array element conversion to `int64[mm]` is not defined

<<< exit
1
